---
title: "Probe: broken links into another directory"
---

Native, missing page: [no page](/adminguide/no-such-page.html).

Native, missing anchor: [no anchor](/adminguide/securing-traffic.html#no-such-anchor).

Passthrough, missing page: [no page as written](../adminguide/no-such-page.html).

Passthrough, missing anchor: [no anchor as written](../adminguide/securing-traffic.html#no-such-anchor).
